@startuml

autonumber

actor "Manager" as Actor
boundary "ProcessFlowPage" as Page
control "ProcessFlowController" as Controller
participant "ProcessFlowService" as Service
participant "MetricsRepository" as Repository
database "duylongcomputer" as Database

Actor -> Page: Navigate to View Business Process Flow (Sơ đồ quy trình)
activate Page

Page -> Controller: GET /api/v1/process-flow/metrics
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: getProcessFlowMetrics()
activate Service

Service -> Repository: fetchNodeMetrics()
activate Repository

Repository -> Database: SELECT status, COUNT(id) \nFROM PURCHASE_ORDERS GROUP BY status
activate Database
Database --> Repository: PO Status Counts
deactivate Database

Repository -> Database: SELECT status, COUNT(id) \nFROM SALES_ORDERS GROUP BY status
activate Database
Database --> Repository: SO Status Counts
deactivate Database

Repository -> Database: SELECT doc_type, status, COUNT(id) \nFROM INVENTORY_DOCUMENTS GROUP BY doc_type, status
activate Database
Database --> Repository: Inventory Document Counts (In/Out/Transfer)
deactivate Database

Repository -> Database: SELECT status, COUNT(id) \nFROM REPAIR_TICKETS GROUP BY status
activate Database
Database --> Repository: Repair Ticket Counts
deactivate Database

Repository --> Service: Map[String, Object] (Raw Metrics)
deactivate Repository

Service -> Service: aggregateFlowData(Raw Metrics)
note right: Map raw database counts to specific\nvisual nodes on the Process Flow\n(e.g., 'Inbound', 'Storage', 'Outbound', 'Services')

Service --> Controller: ProcessFlowDTO
deactivate Service

Controller --> Page: 200 OK (ProcessFlowDTO)
deactivate Controller

Page --> Actor: Hiển thị sơ đồ quy trình nghiệp vụ trực quan\n(Mỗi Node hiển thị số liệu tương ứng)

opt Interact with Process Flow
    Actor -> Page: Click on a specific Node (e.g., "Pending Putaways")
    Page -> Page: Redirect to respective list view\n(e.g., Inventory Documents with pre-applied status filters)
    Page --> Actor: Điều hướng và hiển thị danh sách chi tiết tương ứng
end

deactivate Page

@enduml
